<https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/lords-prayer> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The prayer Jesus taught his disciples, given in a longer form in the Sermon on the Mount (Matthew 6:9-13) and a shorter one in Luke 11:2-4: an address to God as Father followed by petitions for his name, kingdom and will, and for daily bread, forgiveness and deliverance — prayed by Christians of every tradition ever since." .
